        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    rsi_values = [40.5, 42.3, 41.8, 45.2, 47.6, 49.0, 51.3,\n                  48.7, 46.8, 44.9, 42.1, 39.5, 37.2, 36.4, 35.0]\n    lookback_period = 5\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    window = rsi_values[-lookback_period:]\n    min_rsi = min(window)\n    max_rsi = max(window)\n    current_rsi = rsi_values[-1]\n\n    if max_rsi - min_rsi == 0:\n        stoch_rsi = 0.0\n    else:\n        stoch_rsi = (current_rsi - min_rsi) / (max_rsi - min_rsi)\n\n    answer = round(stoch_rsi, 2)\n\n    # return answer\n    return answer\n```",
